  "comments": [
    {"at":0,"placement":"line","text":"Start-up: sets game_mode, front_fighter and shape_page_offset to 0, sets the vectors and the VIC, seeds frame_random with $53, scene_shown 1. Called by cold_start."},
    {"at":18,"placement":"side","text":"Scene 1 is not on the screen, so the first bout draws scene 0."},
    {"at":23,"placement":"line","text":"Fills colour RAM of the text rows 0-4 ($d800-$d8c7) with 6, blue. Called by init_vic_screen."},
    {"at":36,"placement":"line","text":"Fills screen rows 0-4 ($cc00-$ccc7) with spaces. Called by init_vic_screen."},
    {"at":49,"placement":"line","text":"Fills screen and colour RAM of rows 17-24 with $77, so the floor bitmap shows yellow only. Called by init_vic_screen."},
    {"at":62,"placement":"side","text":"Also writes $77 into the sprite pointers $cff8-$cfff; the IRQ sets them again."},
    {"at":69,"placement":"line","text":"Switches the ROMs out ($01 = $05) and stops the CIA 1 interrupts. It enables the raster IRQ, sets the IRQ, NMI and RESET vectors and arms the CIA 2 timer B NMI."},
    {"at":76,"placement":"side","text":"Stops all CIA 1 interrupt sources."},
    {"at":83,"placement":"side","text":"Enables the raster interrupt only."},
    {"at":88,"placement":"side","text":"RAM everywhere with I/O at $d000; no BASIC or KERNAL ROM."},
    {"at":100,"placement":"side","text":"RESET vector to an RTI byte. A real reset switches the ROM in, so the CPU never reads it."},
    {"at":125,"placement":"side","text":"Timer B of CIA 2 gives the NMI of the floor colour split."},
    {"at":142,"placement":"side","text":"Port A of CIA 1 as input for the joystick read."},
    {"at":146,"placement":"line","text":"Lone RTI, the target of the RESET vector at $fffc. No run executes it."},
    {"at":147,"placement":"line","text":"Sets VIC bank 3, screen $cc00 with bitmap and characters at $e000, colours, multicolour sprites and the panel. Called by init_game_state."},
    {"at":152,"placement":"side","text":"Screen $cc00, bitmap and character set $e000."},
    {"at":174,"placement":"side","text":"Bitmap mode; the raster IRQs switch to text for the panel."},
    {"at":184,"placement":"side","text":"Multicolour mode for the bitmap and the panel characters."},
    {"at":239,"placement":"side","text":"Colour $0e (multicolour) on the 16 cells of the four yin-yang symbols."},
    {"at":290,"placement":"line","text":"Puts both fighters at the start: x $3e and $5a, on the ground, facing each other, move and animation $17. Also red for fighter 1 and the AI set-up. Called by bout_loop."},
    {"at":348,"placement":"side","text":"Fighter 1 red again; the bull test sets colour 9."},
    {"at":367,"placement":"line","text":"Clears hit_reaction, $5c and the hold flag $69 of fighter X and sets fighter_move $17. Called by bout_setup_fighters."},
    {"at":380,"placement":"line","text":"Plays one exchange from the start positions until a fighter falls, the time ends or a start key comes. Returns A: $80 key, the reaction move, or 1 time up."},
    {"at":380,"placement":"side","text":"Only the bull test sets the offset nonzero."},
    {"at":409,"placement":"side","text":"Waits for raster line $fd, then does one frame."},
    {"at":435,"placement":"side","text":"A start key in the demo ends the bout with A = $80."},
    {"at":437,"placement":"side","text":"A fall ends the exchange."},
    {"at":449,"placement":"side","text":"The clock runs only after fighter 0 leaves the starting move $17."},
    {"at":462,"placement":"side","text":"Time up: both fighters show frame $37 on the ground."},
    {"at":493,"placement":"line","text":"Cold start: initialises the machine and enters the title loop."},
    {"at":499,"placement":"line","text":"Unused RTS after the JMP of the cold start: an old JSR to the title loop."},
    {"at":500,"placement":"line","text":"Clears the sprite at $c000 (pointer 0), the blank sprite of empty shape parts. Called by init_vic_screen."},
    {"at":511,"placement":"line","text":"Steps frame_random once (shift left, EOR #$1d on carry). Called each frame by bout_loop."}
  ],
